# Work item linking

Read **`INTEGRATION_STACK`** from plugin Configure (default `atlassian`).

## Atlassian stack

- Include a **Jira issue key** in branch name, commit message, or PR title (e.g. `PROJ-123`).
- Pattern: `JIRA_KEY_PATTERN` (default `[A-Z][A-Z0-9]+-\d+`).
- Scope to `JIRA_PROJECT_KEYS` when validating.

## GitHub stack

- Reference **GitHub Issues** in commits or PRs: `#123`, `Fixes #123`, `Closes #123`, or `owner/repo#123`.
- Optional: `GITHUB_ISSUE_LINK_PATTERN` in plugin Configure.

## All stacks

- Commits or PRs without a detectable link trigger the **unlinked work** hook.
- Do not invent issue numbers or keys; use MCP or git/PR text only.
